            { subtitle: "IOSA 效益", eng: "▪ Elimination of audit redundancies\n▪ Reduction of audit resources and costs\n\nPre-IOSA Model:\n▪ Operators were frequently audited by partners\n▪ Audits were conducted to non-common audit standards\n\nPost-IOSA Model:\n▪ One Audit per Airline (24-month interval)", zh: "▪ 消除审计冗余\n▪ 降低审计资源与成本\n\nIOSA之前模式：\n▪ 运营商经常被合作伙伴审计\n▪ 审计按照不统一的审计标准进行\n\nIOSA之后模式：\n▪ 每家航司每24个月进行一次审计" },
            { subtitle: "行业效益", eng: "▪ Reduction of audit resources and costs by elimination of audit redundancies\n▪ First internationally recognized Operational Audit Program continuously updated under the stewardship of IATA\n▪ Reported significant reduction in insurance premiums by Operators that have achieved IOSA Registration", zh: "▪ 通过消除审计冗余，减少审计资源和成本\n▪ 第一个国际认可的运行审计项目，在IATA管理下持续更新\n▪ 已获得IOSA注册的运营商报告的保险费用显著降低" },
            { subtitle: "IOSA 适用性", eng: "▪ Available to all commercial passenger & cargo airlines, regardless of IATA membership\n\nISARPs are applicable only for the audit of an operator that operates a minimum of one (i.e. one or more) multi-engine, two-pilot aircraft with a maximum certificated takeoff mass in excess of 5,700 kg (12,566 lb) to conduct:\n▪ Passenger flights with or without cabin crew\n▪ Cargo flights with or without the carriage of passengers or supernumeraries\n\nISARPs may NOT be applied for the Audit of an operator that either:\n▪ Does not operate a minimum of one aircraft as specified above, or\n▪ Has all aircraft operations conducted by another operator\n\nISARPs may NOT be applied for the Audit of operations conducted with:\n▪ Aircraft with MCTOM ≤ 5,700 kg\n▪ Single engine aircraft\n▪ Piston engine aircraft\n▪ Single pilot aircraft\n▪ Helicopters\n▪ Seaplanes\n\nOther owned or leased aircraft that are not of the type authorized in the AOC and/or not utilized in commercial air transport operations will not be evaluated during an Audit.", zh: "▪ 适用于所有商业客运和货运航空公司，无论是否为IATA成员\n\nISARPs仅适用于对至少运营一架（即一架或多架）双发、双驾驶员、最大审定起飞质量超过5,700公斤（12,566磅）的航空运营人的审计，以执行：\n▪ 客运航班（无论有无客舱机组人员）\n▪ 货运航班（无论是否载有乘客或额外人员）\n\nISARPs不得用于对以下运营人的审计：\n▪ 未运营至少一架上述规格的飞机，或\n▪ 所有飞机运行均由另一运营人执行\n\nISARPs不得用于对以下运行类型的审计：\n▪ 最大审定起飞质量≤5,700公斤的飞机\n▪ 单发飞机\n▪ 活塞发动机飞机\n▪ 单人驾驶飞机\n▪ 直升机\n▪ 水上飞机\n\n其他拥有或租赁的、未在AOC中授权和/或未用于商业航空运输的飞机，在审计期间将不予评估。" },
            { subtitle: "IOSA 注册时间线", eng: "Initial Registration:\n▪ Operator added to IOSA Registry after conduct of initial audit, closure of any associated non-conformities and completion of IATA Quality Control processes.\n\nRegistration Renewal:\n▪ Registration expires 24 months after the Closing Meeting date of the initial IOSA Audit.\n▪ Operators have a 180 day (approx. 6 months) window prior to their Registration Expiry to conduct a renewal audit.\n▪ Registration is renewed when audit is closed and IATA Quality Control processes completed.", zh: "初始注册：\n▪ 完成初始审计、关闭所有相关不符合项、完成IATA质量控制流程后，运营人被加入IOSA登记册。\n\n换证注册：\n▪ 注册在初始IOSA审计关闭会议之日起24个月后到期。\n▪ 运营人在注册到期前有180天（约6个月）的时间窗口进行换证审计。\n▪ 当审计关闭且IATA质量控制流程完成后，注册即获更新。" },
            { subtitle: "向 RBI 转型 (2024-2025)", eng: "2024:\n▪ Transition period for the IOSA Program\n▪ Renewal audits will be conducted by a combination either IATA as a Risk Based IOSA (RBI), or an AO as a standard IOSA Renewal audit.\n▪ Operators selected for an RBI in 2024 were notified in 2023.\n▪ Initial audits are allocated to AOs\n\n2025:\n▪ All renewal audits are conducted by IATA as Risk Based IOSA's\n▪ All initial audits are conducted by IATA", zh: "2024年：\n▪ IOSA项目过渡期\n▪ 换证审计将混合进行：由IATA执行基于风险的IOSA（RBI），或由审计机构执行标准IOSA换证审计\n▪ 2024年被选中进行RBI的运营人已在2023年收到通知\n▪ 初始审计分配给审计机构\n\n2025年：\n▪ 所有换证审计由IATA以基于风险的IOSA方式进行\n▪ 所有初始审计由IATA执行" },
            { subtitle: "审计机构 (AO)", eng: "▪ Accredited by IATA\n▪ Must meet IOSA Program Standards (IPM)\n▪ Responsible for the conduct of full scope and remote audits\n▪ Employ only approved IOSA Auditors\n▪ Guarantee auditor qualification and currency\n▪ Under the oversight of IATA", zh: "▪ 由IATA认证\n▪ 必须满足IOSA项目标准（IPM）\n▪ 负责执行全范围和远程审计\n▪ 仅雇佣经批准的IOSA审计员\n▪ 保证审计员的资质和时效性\n▪ 受IATA监督" },
            { subtitle: "语言要求", eng: "English is the official language of the IOSA Program and the IOSA Documentation system.\n\nDocumentation is written in international English using: www.merriam-webster.com", zh: "英语是IOSA项目和IOSA文件体系的官方语言。\n\n文件使用国际英语编写，词典参考：www.merriam-webster.com" },
            { subtitle: "IOSA 登记册与审计共享 (IAR)", eng: "\"The process whereby an interested party utilizes the audit of an operator, conducted by a third party, to satisfy its own need for an audit of that same operator.\"\n\n▪ IAR is the sole and exclusive property of the IOSA Operator\n▪ Access to an IAR shall be granted to an interested party by IATA only after the Operator that owns the IAR has specifically authorized such access\n▪ IATA is the official custodian of the IAR in the IOSA database and shall provide controlled IAR access to an interested party in accordance with IPM", zh: "\"相关方利用第三方对运营人进行的审计，来满足自身对该运营人审计需求的过程。\"\n\n▪ IAR（IOSA审计报告）是IOSA运营人的独有和排他性财产\n▪ 只有在拥有IAR的运营人明确授权后，IATA才能向相关方授予对IAR的访问权限\n▪ IATA是IOSA数据库中IAR的官方保管人，并应按照IPM规定向相关方提供受控的IAR访问权限" }
